    Bug 1806770 - Consolidate some IMAP msgKey<->UID mapping to ease eventual separation. r=mkmelin

    This patch factors out a bunch of helper functions that perform msgKey<->UID mapping.
    These helpers currently just cast directly between nsMsgKey and ImapUid, but they are set up to be replaced with code that performs real database queries when the types are actually treated separately.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D307679

